    "detailed_description": "<h1>Add Fury Race to your Wishlist!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657300/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1752745667\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657300/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1752745667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657300/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1752745667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Craft, upgrade and race your way through a post-apocalyptic world filled with zombies and enemy cars. Build the ultimate vehicle and equip it with powerful weapons to smash through obstacles and take out mad bots. Can you survive the wasteland and become the ultimate racer?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE AI HAS GONE MAD AND PUT THE WORLD INTO CHAOS!</h2>Fight hordes of bot racers capable of destroying all life in their path. You will overcome them only with your agility, skillful driving and... a powerful guns!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657300/extras/ec8aef5fea9bc8b0f037a1d6ccf8dd03.poster.avif?t=1752745667\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657300/extras/ec8aef5fea9bc8b0f037a1d6ccf8dd03.webm?t=1752745667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657300/extras/ec8aef5fea9bc8b0f037a1d6ccf8dd03.mp4?t=1752745667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPERIMENT TO YOUR OWN STYLE</h2>Build and customize your own vehicle to suit your wishes and needs. Find your approach to destroying enemies and breaking obstacles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657300/extras/7ce1427dcdc4311f12a80061e25e5c11.poster.avif?t=1752745667\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657300/extras/7ce1427dcdc4311f12a80061e25e5c11.webm?t=1752745667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657300/extras/7ce1427dcdc4311f12a80061e25e5c11.mp4?t=1752745667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARCADE COMBAT RACING</h2>The path to success is possible through the selection and timing of abilities, precise drifting in the corners and adapting to the dynamic track environment. Prepare and react with lightning speed!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657300/extras/53c6f0e082fb6dc20367f03c7ac8b29a.poster.avif?t=1752745667\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657300/extras/53c6f0e082fb6dc20367f03c7ac8b29a.webm?t=1752745667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657300/extras/53c6f0e082fb6dc20367f03c7ac8b29a.mp4?t=1752745667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Craft, upgrade and race your way through a post-apocalyptic world filled with zombies and enemy cars. Build the ultimate vehicle and equip it with powerful weapons to smash through obstacles and take out mad bots. Can you survive the wasteland and become the ultimate racer?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE AI HAS GONE MAD AND PUT THE WORLD INTO CHAOS!</h2>Fight hordes of bot racers capable of destroying all life in their path. You will overcome them only with your agility, skillful driving and... a powerful guns!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657300/extras/ec8aef5fea9bc8b0f037a1d6ccf8dd03.poster.avif?t=1752745667\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657300/extras/ec8aef5fea9bc8b0f037a1d6ccf8dd03.webm?t=1752745667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657300/extras/ec8aef5fea9bc8b0f037a1d6ccf8dd03.mp4?t=1752745667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPERIMENT TO YOUR OWN STYLE</h2>Build and customize your own vehicle to suit your wishes and needs. Find your approach to destroying enemies and breaking obstacles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657300/extras/7ce1427dcdc4311f12a80061e25e5c11.poster.avif?t=1752745667\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657300/extras/7ce1427dcdc4311f12a80061e25e5c11.webm?t=1752745667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657300/extras/7ce1427dcdc4311f12a80061e25e5c11.mp4?t=1752745667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARCADE COMBAT RACING</h2>The path to success is possible through the selection and timing of abilities, precise drifting in the corners and adapting to the dynamic track environment. Prepare and react with lightning speed!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657300/extras/53c6f0e082fb6dc20367f03c7ac8b29a.poster.avif?t=1752745667\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657300/extras/53c6f0e082fb6dc20367f03c7ac8b29a.webm?t=1752745667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657300/extras/53c6f0e082fb6dc20367f03c7ac8b29a.mp4?t=1752745667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
